      "name": "Vault MCP",
      "description": "Private HELM credential-reference MCP endpoint. Claude only: verified 2026-10-02 that this server rejects ?token= in the URL (401) and accepts only the x-api-key header, so it cannot work on header-less platforms (ChatGPT, Grok) until the server accepts a URL token.",
